<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 01:30:50 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>细胞外磷酸盐通过 H2O2 介导的激酶氧化非常规激活原癌基因 FGFR1</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/unconventional-activation-of-the-protooncogene-fgfr1-by-extracellular-phosphate-via-h2o2mediated-kinase-oxidation</link><description>该网站使用安全服务来防范恶意机器人。当网站验证您不是机器人时会显示此页面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/unconventional-activation-of-the-protooncogene-fgfr1-by-extracellular-phosphate-via-h2o2mediated-kinase-oxidation2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 01:30:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/unconventional-activation-of-the-protooncogene-fgfr1-by-extracellular-phosphate-via-h2o2mediated-kinase-oxidation</guid></item><item><title>在子宫内膜异位症的痛苦驱使下，这位科学家正在寻找其病因的线索</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/driven-by-the-pain-of-endometriosis-this-scientist-is-uncovering-clues-to-its-causes</link><description>凯蒂·伯恩斯 (Katie Burns) 正在帮助揭示免疫系统在这种长期被忽视的疾病中的作用&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/driven-by-the-pain-of-endometriosis-this-scientist-is-uncovering-clues-to-its-causes.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 01:15:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/driven-by-the-pain-of-endometriosis-this-scientist-is-uncovering-clues-to-its-causes</guid></item><item><title>定制的 FcγR 阻断增强免疫检查点治疗并克服耐药性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/tailored-fc%ce%b3r-blockade-enhances-immune-checkpoint-therapy-and-overcomes-resistance</link><description>Fc-γ 受体 (FcγR) 调节 IgG 抗体活性，Fc 工程是一种经过验证的提高肿瘤靶向抗体功效的方法。在这里，我们探索定制的 FcγR 阻断，以增强免疫检查点阻断 (ICB) 抗体的治疗功效和耐受性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tailored-fcceb3r-blockade-enhances-immune-checkpoint-therapy-and-overcomes-resistance2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 01:00:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/tailored-fc%ce%b3r-blockade-enhances-immune-checkpoint-therapy-and-overcomes-resistance</guid></item><item><title>智能传感器通过记住过去来识别当前分子</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/smart-sensor-identifies-present-molecules-by-remembering-the-past</link><description>大多数传感器的设计目的只有一件事：检测穿过它们的物体。但如果传感器可以做得更多呢？为了创造新一代技术，研究人员从生命系统中寻找灵感。如果传感器可以检测分子，它是否也可以记住之前的相互作用并选择性地对其做出响应？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/smart-sensor-identifies-present-molecules-by-remembering-the-past.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 00:45:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/smart-sensor-identifies-present-molecules-by-remembering-the-past</guid></item><item><title>高粒度探测器中点云分割的对比度量学习</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/contrastive-metric-learning-for-point-cloud-segmentation-in-highly-granular-detectors</link><description>一种新颖的聚类方法表明，基于相似性的表示学习与基于密度的聚合相结合是高粒度粒子探测器中点云分割的一种有前途的策略。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/contrastive-metric-learning-for-point-cloud-segmentation-in-highly-granular-detectors2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 00:30:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/contrastive-metric-learning-for-point-cloud-segmentation-in-highly-granular-detectors</guid></item><item><title>服用抗白细胞介素 5 生物制剂的哮喘患者出现嗜酸性粒细胞增多并伴有铜绿假单胞菌感染</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/hypereosinophilia-with-pseudomonas-aeruginosa-infection-in-patients-with-asthma-on-antiinterleukin5-biologics</link><description>针对 IL-5 或其受体的生物疗法可减少嗜酸性粒细胞增多和哮喘恶化。突破性嗜酸性粒细胞攻击通常被认为是生物学失败。我们报告了 2 名接受美泊利珠单抗或贝那利珠单抗治疗的严重哮喘患者，他们出现了与以下疾病相关的复发性嗜酸性粒细胞增多症： &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/hypereosinophilia-with-pseudomonas-aeruginosa-infection-in-patients-with-asthma-on-antiinterleukin5-biologics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 00:15:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/hypereosinophilia-with-pseudomonas-aeruginosa-infection-in-patients-with-asthma-on-antiinterleukin5-biologics</guid></item><item><title>约翰霍普金斯大学的人工智能语音控制机器人执行自主手术</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/johns-hopkins-ai-powered-voice-controlled-robot-performs-autonomous-surgery</link><description>约翰·霍普金斯大学的研究人员表明，人工智能驱动的机器人经过先前手术视频的训练，可以学习如何自行执行手术，而无需人类操作员的帮助。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/johns-hopkins-ai-powered-voice-controlled-robot-performs-autonomous-surgery3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 00:00:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/johns-hopkins-ai-powered-voice-controlled-robot-performs-autonomous-surgery</guid></item><item><title>衰老限制了人类免疫中CXCL13+滤泡辅助T细胞的成熟</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/aging-restricts-maturation-of-cxcl13-t-follicular-helper-cells-in-human-immunity</link><description>布雷西等人。研究表明，随着年龄的增长，抗体反应受损主要是由滤泡辅助 T 细胞成熟缺陷而非内在 B 细胞功能障碍引起的。他们发现人类特有的缺失&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/aging-restricts-maturation-of-cxcl13-t-follicular-helper-cells-in-human-immunity.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 23:45:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/aging-restricts-maturation-of-cxcl13-t-follicular-helper-cells-in-human-immunity</guid></item><item><title>提高大功率电子产品的性能</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/improving-the-performance-of-highpower-electronics</link><description>麻省理工学院的工程师使用一层薄薄的金刚石来管理过多的热量，可以提高下一代无线设备的速度和能源效率。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/improving-the-performance-of-highpower-electronics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 23:30:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/improving-the-performance-of-highpower-electronics</guid></item><item><title>眼神接触有助于婴儿“适应”说话者的脑电波并学习语言</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/eye-contact-helps-infants-tune-in-to-speakers-brainwaves-and-learn-language</link><description>剑桥和新加坡的科学家表明，婴儿通过与说话者的目光接触来确定要注意的内容并同步他们的脑电波，从而帮助他们学习语言。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/eye-contact-helps-infants-tune-in-to-speakers-brainwaves-and-learn-language.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 23:15:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/eye-contact-helps-infants-tune-in-to-speakers-brainwaves-and-learn-language</guid></item></channel></rss>